markedup_text = "Remove the cursed painting."
requirement = SubResource("Resource_6l3ia")
outcome = SubResource("Resource_vpjr2")
markedup_result_text = "Assuming the painting to be the source of the trouble, the settlers take it out and store it in a locked cellar.

The next night, the same roars are heard from the forest, but sounding perhaps even louder and more annoyed."

